 """Orchestrates persistence + fulfilment for a payment provider callback.
 
-Known gap (tracked by PAY-DEMO-001): a duplicate callback for the same
-provider_event_id currently triggers fulfilment again instead of being
-recognized as already processed.
+Idempotency (PAY-DEMO-001): fulfilment is gated on the persistence-layer
+claim (record_if_new()). A duplicate callback for an already-completed or
+currently in-flight provider_event_id is recognized and never re-fulfilled.
+If fulfilment fails after the event is claimed, the claim is released so a
+later retry with the same provider_event_id can re-claim and attempt
+fulfilment again.
 """
 from __future__ import annotations
 
